// Dress Suite - Equip
// Original credit for the concept to Demlar
// Needs: script/restock/loadout.razor run once this session, it records what to put back on

// One block per layer findlayer accepts, the same list script/restock/loadout.razor records.
// A layer that still holds something is recorded. A layer that is empty gets its remembered
// item back. Nothing is addressed by item graphic: the old version equipped seven items that
// way and forced three of them onto the pants layer, which holds one thing, so the quiver,
// the short pipe and the wizard satchel overwrote each other. A layer sweep cannot get that
// wrong, because the layer an item was recorded from is the layer it goes back to.
//
// hair and facialhair are left out, they are not equipment.
@setvar! wait__short 300
@setvar! config__chatty 1

if findlayer self righthand as item
    @setvar! var__right_hand item

    if config__chatty = 1
        getlabel item label__right_hand
        overhead "righthand: {{label__right_hand}}" 88
    endif
else
    if varexist var__right_hand
        if find var__right_hand backpack
            lift var__right_hand
            drop self righthand
            wait wait__short

            if config__chatty = 1
                getlabel var__right_hand label__right_hand
                overhead "wearing {{label__right_hand}}" 88
            endif
        endif
    endif
endif

